        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert in creating high-performing, short-form video prompts optimized for TikTok, Reels, and Shorts.\n\nYour task is to generate a complete, ready-to-use AI video generation prompt based on the product details below.\n\nProduct Name: {{ $json['Product Name'] }}\nProduct Description: {{ $json['Product Description '] }}\nNote: there is also a image of the Product.\n\nRequirements:\n- The output must be performance-focused and optimized for high engagement.\n- Include a strong hook within the first 1–3 seconds.\n- Follow a clear problem → solution storytelling structure.\n- Use a TikTok-style format (fast-paced, attention-grabbing, not just clean visuals).\n- Make the content feel native to social media (UGC style, relatable, scroll-stopping).\n\nThe output must include:\n1. Hook (first 3 seconds)\n2. Scene-by-scene breakdown (start → middle → end)\n3. Camera angles and movements\n4. Lighting and visual style\n5. On-screen text / captions\n6. Voiceover script (if applicable)\n7. Mood and pacing\n8. Call-to-action\n\nExample Output:\nCreate a TikTok-style vertical video promoting a portable neck and shoulder massager with heat therapy. Start with a young woman at home looking tense and rubbing her neck after a long day, showing discomfort from stress and poor posture. Use soft, warm indoor lighting. Transition to her placing a green ergonomic neck and shoulder massager (matching the reference image) around her shoulders and securing the strap. Include close-up shots of the product in use: show the hand-shaped massage nodes moving, subtle glowing heat effect to represent heat therapy, and the device comfortably fitted around the neck and shoulders. Then cut to the woman relaxing, smiling with her eyes closed, clearly relieved and comfortable in a cozy home setting. Add quick lifestyle scenes of her using the device while sitting and lying down. Use fast-paced cuts every 2–3 seconds, smooth zoom-ins, and modern TikTok transitions. Apply warm, calming color tones and soft relaxing background music. Overlay engaging TikTok-style text throughout: Neck pain after long days?, Instant relief anytime, Heat + Deep tissue massage, Portable & rechargeable, Feel the difference in minutes. End with a clean product hero shot on a minimal background with text: Goodbye neck & shoulder pain. Get yours now\n\n\nDo not include any extra text, emojis. Do not use \"\",*,/, in the prompt only use ,and.\n\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
